@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@
+---
+name: consult
+description: Ask a strong model for mathematical strategy from the current Danus elaboration, record the reply as master_guidance, and assign workers from it. Use at project start and after meaningful new findings, dead ends, verified facts, or sustained stalls.
+---
+
+# Consult for strategy
+
+Prepare an elaboration from the project's global memory and fact graph. Publish
+that elaboration with `mcp__danus__gm_add`, then send the same text to the consult command:
+
+```bash
+consult --file <elaboration.md> --project <project_dir> --out <reply.md>
+```
+
+The default transport is `dsh`. It inherits the operator's DeepSeek Harness
+provider/model selection and uses the requested reasoning variant. An explicit
+strategy model can be recorded in `DANUS_CONSULT_DSH_MODEL`.
+
+Useful per-call settings are:
+
+```bash
+consult --file <elaboration.md> --project <project_dir> \
+  --effort high --tools web --out <reply.md>
+```
+
+The command returns a JSON envelope containing `transport`, `model`, `effort`,
+`status`, elapsed seconds, and the reply. It also records the consultation in the
+project ledger.
+
+On a completed consult, publish the full reply as the evidence of a
+`master_guidance` global-memory entry and link it to the elaboration entry. Keep
+the consult reply intact. Use your judgment when converting its branches into
+individual `danus assign <project>/<worker>` tasks.
+
+On an error or empty reply, report the returned error and leave
+`master_guidance` unchanged. A later attempt can select a different
+provider/model or reasoning variant. When `DANUS_CONSULT_TRANSPORT=off`, reason
+from the elaboration in the main session and label that guidance as main-agent
+authored.
+
+Consult after real changes in shared state. A completed worker round, a new
+verified fact, a substantive dead end, and a sustained stall are suitable
+triggers. A two-hour interval is a useful upper pacing reference for a long run.
+Use `schedule_create` to inspect for those events while the DeepSeek Harness
+session remains active.
